sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Client as Next.js Client
    participant API as Route /api/chat
    participant Limits as Limits & Credit Governor
    participant Neon as Neon Postgres
    participant Qdrant as Qdrant Vector Store
    participant LangChain as LangChain RAG Pipeline
    participant LLM as OpenAI Chat LLM
    participant Tavily as Tavily Web Search

    User->>Client: Type question & submit prompt
    Client->>API: POST /api/chat { notebookId, prompt }
    API->>Limits: Check available daily credits (> 0)
    alt Zero Credits Available
        Limits-->>API: 403 Forbidden (Daily limit reached)
        API-->>Client: Render Zero Credits Neo-Brutalist Banner
    end

    API->>Limits: Consume 1 credit
    API-)Neon: Non-blocking INSERT telemetry_chat_prompts (userId, notebookId, promptLengthChars)

    API->>Qdrant: Scoped cosine search (filter: notebookId, topK: 5, minScore: 0.30)
    Qdrant-->>API: Retrieved chunks with similarity scores & metadata

    alt Max Score < 0.30 (No matching source material)
        API-->>Client: Stream Honest Refusal: "The uploaded sources do not contain information regarding this query."
        API-->>Client: Emit Fallback Card: [Search Web & Answer (1 Credit)]
        opt User Clicks Fallback
            User->>Client: Click [Search Web & Answer]
            Client->>API: POST /api/chat { notebookId, prompt, fallback: true }
            API->>Limits: Consume 1 credit
            API->>Tavily: Search live web (top 3 results)
            Tavily-->>API: Web search results
            API->>LangChain: Synthesize answer with [Web: domain.com] markers
            LangChain->>LLM: Stream completion
            LLM-->>Client: Streamed response with verified web citations
        end
    else Chunks Found (Max Score >= 0.30)
        API->>Neon: Fetch last 7 conversation turns (sliding window)
        Neon-->>API: Chat turns history
        API->>LangChain: Assemble prompt with <chunk id="c_123" ...> boundaries
        LangChain->>LLM: Stream completion (enforce [[C:chunkId]] markers)
        LLM-->>Client: SSE Stream: tokens + citation tokens [[C:chunkId]]
        Client->>Client: Parse tokens dynamically into Inline Citation Pills [1], [2]
        API->>Neon: Persist user prompt & assistant response in chat_messages
    end
